+# Corpus fetching
+
+The corpus fetch respected Svipall's per-domain limit of **12 visits per
+60-second window**. After a breach, that domain entered a **900-second
+(15-minute) cooldown**.
+
+Files were fetched through these hosts:
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com`
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net`, using paths of the form
+  `https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/owner/repo@branch/path`
+- `cdn.statically.io` (attempted as a mirror, but it was slow and sometimes
+  timed out)
+
